gate: OPEN
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:frontend
task: S16 T2 — Welcome screen visual parity (Login layout, no auth)
sprint: S16
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md

context: |
  Intake #1+#3. Mix: mobile-apps Login composition (Logo, motion, glass CTA) + customer splash structure
  (full-bleed atmospheric/industrial background, brand+version top). Use NaviTrack Logo — not ESCORT mark.
  Background asset: suitable photo under public/ (may adapt customer tanker mood; license/owned asset).
  NO username/password/OTP/biometry/cloud login. Cold-start before home hub.
  i18n en/uk/ru. Package manager: bun.

out:
  - src/screens/welcome/WelcomeScreen.tsx
  - src/screens/welcome/*.test.tsx
  - src/store/useNavigationStore.ts (welcome screen id)
  - src/locales/{en,uk,ru}.json
  - shell ScreenRouter / MobileShell wiring

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - Welcome matches LoginScreen layout/motion/Logo (no auth fields)
  - App can cold-start on welcome
  - Locales + Vitest coverage
  - `bun run test` passes
